OL,3,GNEWSAWallaby spotted hopping through
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wallaby has been spotted hopping
OL,7,Fthrough a town centre in Cornwall.
OL,9,FA pastry shop owner told BBC Cornwall
OL,10,Fhe was driving to work at about 05:30
OL,11,FBST on Monday when he noticed the
OL,12,Fmammal jumping through the streets of
OL,13,FLiskeard.
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,16,Fwere called to reports of a wallaby
OL,17,Fseen on Dean Street but, after a search
OL,18,Fof the area, they could not find it.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
