OL,3,GNEWSAWallaby spotted hopping through
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA said it urged anyone who
OL,7,Fspotted a wallaby in the wild to "watch
OL,8,Ffrom afar, enjoy the unusual sight and
OL,9,Fdon't try to approach them".
